     "<div><div style=\"display:inline;width:576px\"><div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Hi all!  It&#39;s time to pick times and topics for the next quarter&#39;s D-RUG.  Please fill out the form below to have your say.</p>\r\nIf you have trouble viewing or submitting this form, you can fill it out online:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1JuD9MuM20V_R0v2_RY61Xy1PautjstHP88-5HH1Xmqg/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1JuD9MuM20V_R0v2_RY61Xy1PautjstHP88-5HH1Xmqg/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469071673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PWBRPAcWkONsDy3t0lYcA\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1JuD9MuM20V_R0v2_RY61Xy1PautjstHP88-5HH1Xmqg/viewform</a>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:.67em 0\">D-RUG Spring Meeting Time Survey</h1></div>\r\n<div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;display:inline\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div><div><form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1JuD9MuM20V_R0v2_RY61Xy1PautjstHP88-5HH1Xmqg/formResponse\" method=\"POST\" target=\"_blank\"><div role=\"list\">\r\n<div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">What times can you meet?\r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Please check all times that work for you</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"group\" aria-label=\"What times can you meet? Please check all times that work for you Please select at least one!\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.5em 0 0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Mon 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Mon 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Mon 3-5\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Mon 3-5</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Tues 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Tues 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Tues 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Tues 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Tues 3-5\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Tues 3-5</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Wed 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Wed 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Wed 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Wed 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Wed 3-5\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Wed 3-5</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Thu 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Thu 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Thu 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Thu 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Fri 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Fri 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"__other_option__\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-required></span>\r\nOther:</label>\r\n<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.2079587304.other_option_response\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Other\"></span>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">Would you like to present at a D-RUG meeting this winter?\r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Would you like to present at a D-RUG meeting this winter?  \" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.5em 0 0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;How-to&quot; on some topic or tool.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;How-to&quot; on some topic or tool.\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;How-to&quot; on some topic or tool.</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Both!\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Both!\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Both!</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Probably not.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Probably not.\" aria-required></span>\r\n<span>Probably not.</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">If you selected &quot;Yup!&quot;, any idea what the topic would be?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">This isn&#39;t written in stone or anything. I just want to get an idea of how many people are interested in presenting and what the potential topics might be.</div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.1158270743\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"If you selected &quot;Yup!&quot;, any idea what the topic would be? This isn&#39;t written in stone or anything. I just want to get an idea of how many people are interested in presenting and what the potential topics might be. \" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">Are there any topics or activities you&#39;d like to see covered by others at D-RUG this winter?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.305988350\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Are there any topics or activities you&#39;d like to see covered by others at D-RUG this winter?  \" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">Can you volunteer to run D-RUG some weeks?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">This would entail opening the room, setting up if there is a speaker, getting cookies (you&#39;ll be reimbursed), and providing basic level R-help. This would probably be once per quarter or less.</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Can you volunteer to run D-RUG some weeks? This would entail opening the room, setting up if there is a speaker, getting cookies (you&#39;ll be reimbursed), and providing basic level R-help. This would probably be once per quarter or less. \" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.5em 0 0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.805874680\" value=\"Yup!\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Yup!</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">Your E-mail \r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1862046737\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Your E-mail   \" aria-required title=\"\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">Your Department / Graduate Group / Other affiliation\r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1155336748\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Your Department / Graduate Group / Other affiliation  \" aria-required title=\"\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"draftResponse\" value=\"[,,&quot;5521624163322074796&quot;]\r\n\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"pageHistory\" value=\"0\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"fromEmail\" value=\"true\">\r\n\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"fbzx\" value=\"5521624163322074796\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><table><tbody><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margi